Spotify doesn't own the music. Roughly 70% of its revenue goes back to labels, publishers and songwriters — over $10 billion in 2024 alone. Full documentary: {LONG}
Sources: Spotify newsroom, The Irish Times, Wikipedia.
#Spotify #Music #shorts

After years of losses, Spotify made about €2.2 billion of operating profit in 2025 — and paid only about €12 million of income tax, thanks to credits from its loss-making years. Full documentary: {LONG}
Sources: Spotify Q4 2025 results, Complete Music Update.
